# Allowlist. The build context is uploaded to the builder, so this is a HARD boundary, not a
# size optimisation: it must exclude the four copyrighted insurer wordings and every measured
# result, shipping ONLY the two public IRDAI PDFs, their census, the IRDAI-only manifest, and
# the source. Start by excluding everything, then re-include exactly what the image needs.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src

# data: exclude all, then re-include only the IRDAI public artifacts
!data
data/*
!data/deploy
data/deploy/*
!data/deploy/irdai_sources.jsonl
!data/deploy/probe_report.json
!data/raw
data/raw/*
!data/raw/irdai-master-circular-2024.pdf
!data/raw/irdai-annexure-2024.pdf

# never, under any re-include
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.git
.venv
